    "bio": "Sanju Viswanath Samson is an Indian cricketer who represents the India national cricket team in the T20I format. Born on November 11, 1994, in Thiruvananthapuram, Kerala, he is a right-handed wicketkeeper-batter known for his elegant stroke play and ability to score briskly. Samson made his T20I debut for India on July 19, 2015, against Zimbabwe. He has been a part of India's T20 World Cup winning teams in 2024 and 2026, and was named Player of the Tournament in the 2026 edition.",
